{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Merges",
    "description": "TestSchema_Golden merges, into the property a of each case, every schema of its prefixItems in turn, failing with x-error where it has one, and drops the merged ones: the document must then be after.json. The components without properties a are what the cases refer to. Edit both by hand.",
